Next: Module 7, organic chemistry.

172
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:00,340
Here are the key notes.

173
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:02,500
Pause the video if you need more time

174
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:03,380
to copy them.
